		{"id":"694eb392c37b37df","type":"text","text":"## 問題","x":934,"y":1781,"width":147,"height":50,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d6a15934ab3721a7","type":"link","url":"https://youtu.be/GqBIt3u26do?si=G7BL2LE_vqgIkb79","x":-1702,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":216,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f35a5238fcc36416","type":"text","text":"在整理整份筆記的時候，很難看到目前筆記整體的階層架構，\n不清楚現在要用什麼階層來記錄目前的內容","x":-1322,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":122,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"5a32bfd35e060311","type":"text","text":"更改一個段落，底下階層也需要一併更改，\nex: \n- 將一個 Heading 拖到文件的最一開頭，底下的所有子階層也要同時改到最一開始\n- 將一個 Heading 2 改成 heading 1，底下的 heading 3 → Heading 4, Heading 4 → Heading 5, 以此類推","x":2538,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":312,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"57c1acb256cae940","type":"text","text":"小區塊的呈現方式，\n查看 github md 的準則或許有幫助？\n或是將這個設定交給使用者\nex: \nquote 應該跟段落一起呈現？\nlist item 也需要跟段落一起呈現？","x":2918,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":186,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"75f905a7a4819fe4","type":"text","text":"### 佈局方式","x":3298,"y":1960,"width":160,"height":50,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"962d1d28a75e3a2e","type":"text","text":"計算同個階層的元素，算出寬度平均值，方便觀看？","x":1398,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"8cf421332e7b6daf","type":"text","text":"我需要將 Heading 底下的敘述轉成 tooltip 還是一樣以 block 呈現","x":1778,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":91,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0d1af229256733a6","type":"text","text":"### 同步問題","x":2158,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8f05caa90405e988","type":"text","text":"快速的調整目前階層，\nex:\n我需要將 Head1 底下的 head 3 統統調整成 head 2, \n目前有套件可以做，\n[k4a-l/obsidian-heading-shifter: Easily Shift and Change markdown headings.](https://github.com/k4a-l/obsidian-heading-shifter)\n但不方便也沒有圖來的直觀知道那些 heading 需要移動，希望能直接拖動就可以調整全部","x":-942,"y":1960,"width":400,"height":264,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b2767f40e1dfbeff","type":"text","text":"需要在心智圖模式下可以編輯","x":-502,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":50,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"74b5f8a30c22f018","type":"text","text":"不一定只能呈現一種格式，\n也可以呈現魚骨圖之類的","x":-122,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":59,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"3378bf097431e042","type":"text","text":"當前區塊置中呈現","x":258,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":59,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"9e5afc6f4aa1233f","type":"text","text":"可以拖拉 (Drag Drop)\n改變階層","x":638,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":59,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"3bd25d881820837b","type":"text","text":"需要有 short command 方便編輯","x":1018,"y":1960,"width":340,"height":59,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"e00f9298b437f134","type":"text","text":"是否可以取得切換之前的 markdown editor，即使 view 更改，但只要有 property 記錄 editor，我依然可以\n- 藉由此 editor 發送改動 transaction?\n- 且可以藉由此 editor 接受其他 editro 的 transaction?","x":828,"y":2360,"width":340,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"abb6ee97ac9a5000","type":"text","text":"如何同步至其他 editor?","x":1208,"y":2360,"width":340,"height":50,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"75a130c93864794f","type":"text","text":"每個文件記錄自定義佈局？\n，有點麻煩，當作進階功能，不需要現在想","x":2348,"y":2360,"width":340,"height":91,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"55c885e8586c2b49","type":"text","text":"如何佈局？\n如何自動改變佈局\n佈局的演算法?\n水平展開 → 垂直展開","x":2728,"y":2360,"width":300,"height":91,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d09e314b97843a06","type":"text","text":"其他 editor 如何同步至目前文件？","x":1588,"y":2360,"width":340,"height":50,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"76500f0ec40e58ff","type":"text","text":"#### 如何縮放呈現大小？\ncss: zoom, scale? 或 js 設定？\n\n","x":3068,"y":2360,"width":340,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"9b3b66eb2b43b425","type":"text","text":"重新渲染的時機？\nhtml component 的 key 要用什麼？\n\n如何 parser 使用者輸入的文字內容？\nex: \n- 在同一個 block 輸入了2 段，要直接幫使用者拆成 2 個 block?\n- 使用者在 Heading 2 下的 block\n  輸入了 Heading 1 要自動把下面的內容都往上一階層拉？\n  還是應該自動將其變成 Heading 3?","x":1968,"y":2360,"width":340,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"7103f182d3bcfa55","type":"text","text":"快速的調整目前階層，\nex:\n我需要將 Head1 底下的 head 3 統統調整成 head 2, \n目前有套件可以做，\n[k4a-l/obsidian-heading-shifter: Easily Shift and Change markdown headings.](https://github.com/k4a-l/obsidian-heading-shifter)\n但不方便也沒有圖來的直觀知道那些 heading 需要移動，希望能直接拖動就可以調整全部","x":-50,"y":-490,"width":400,"height":264,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d41e718949402605","type":"text","text":"本質上還是編輯 markdown\n只是以圖示呈現整體 layout,\n方便你知道目前的文件架構","x":-50,"y":-762,"width":340,"height":122,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e27f85f314914c60","type":"link","url":"https://youtu.be/GqBIt3u26do?si=G7BL2LE_vqgIkb79","x":-50,"y":-1140,"width":340,"height":216,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"815806a09dea21e1","type":"text","text":"在整理整份筆記的時候，很難看到目前筆記整體的階層架構，\n不清楚現在要用什麼階層來記錄目前的內容","x":-50,"y":-626,"width":340,"height":122,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"7b77c4128a7f3e6b","type":"text","text":"需要有 short command 方便編輯\n- 跳到當前 Heading 區段下的最 前/底 區塊\n- 跳到當前階層的最前/底區塊\n- 合併 2 個相鄰區塊(上/下)\n- ","x":350,"y":-11,"width":250,"height":265,"color":"6"},
