		{"id":"31b7d6877e5ef7fb","type":"text","text":"svelte codemirror\ndrag and drop panel (event)","x":-50,"y":337,"width":340,"height":91,"color":"#d0db9b"},
		{"id":"1b54c14508f93a4a","type":"text","text":"如何佈局？\n如何自動改變佈局\n佈局的演算法?\n水平展開 → 垂直展開\n\nLogic Chart\n\n魚骨圖？Fishbone\n偵測區塊的邏輯很難做？\n\n對稱圖？Mind Map\n","x":360,"y":911,"width":300,"height":290,"color":"4"},
